    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186083201,
      "id": "dc6d9b69-0459-515a-ba7b-c62cab96ca00",
      "title": "Identifying Divergent Improper Integrals"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "929130cf-ab27-5ff7-96bc-9d038dbb6228",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following improper integrals are divergent?\n- **I.** ${\\int }_{201}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x-5}}\\,\\text{d}x$\n- **II.** ${\\int }_{1}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt[3]{{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x$\n- **III.** ${\\int }_{-\\infty }^{-1}\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x$\n\nSelect all that apply.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Let's work out each integral.\n\nFor the first integral, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{201}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x-5}}\\,\\text{d}x & ={lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{\\int }_{201}^{a}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x-5}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{[2\\sqrt{x-5}]}_{201}^{a} \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to \\infty }(2\\sqrt{a-5}-2\\sqrt{201-5}) \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to \\infty }(2\\sqrt{a-5}-28) \\\\  & =\\infty ,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nso the integral diverges.\n\nFor the second integral, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt[3]{{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & ={lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{\\int }_{1}^{a}\\frac{1}{3}\\,{x}^{-2/3}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{[{x}^{1/3}]}_{1}^{a} \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to \\infty }(\\sqrt[3]{a}-1) \\\\  & =\\infty ,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nso the integral diverges.\n\nFor the third integral, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{-1}\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & ={lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }{\\int }_{a}^{-1}\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }{[-\\frac{1}{x}]}_{a}^{-1} \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }(1+\\frac{1}{a}) \\\\  & =1,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nso the integral is convergent.\n\nIn conclusion, only integrals I and II are divergent.",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "6ece85a1-ff9f-5f21-bf5d-5d1ba87b1f6d",
